Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.80,0:00:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Legends of Sports Heroes: Dunk for Victories.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.52,0:00:16.80,Title,,0,0,0,,The Power of an Idol
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.16,0:12:36.96,end,,0,0,0,,To be continued…
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.64,0:00:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,In the previous episode, Team Goats was facing difficulties in recruiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.04,0:00:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Motivated by delicious food, Paddi passed the team entrance test.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.64,0:00:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He showcased his shooting talent and became the first new player on Team Goats.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.36,0:00:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But Team Goats’ recruitment journey has only just begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.92,0:00:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Start dribbling practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.20,0:01:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Start passing practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.72,0:01:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.08,0:01:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, you’ve worked hard. Take a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.16,0:01:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Jonie.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.20,0:01:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m so tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.52,0:01:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Our dribbling and passing skills are terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.64,0:01:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,After a quick break, let’s get back to training.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.84,0:02:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Your skills definitely need improvement.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.72,0:02:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But judging by how the training is going,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.20,0:02:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,our top priority is finding a point guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.28,0:02:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,A point guard?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.16,0:02:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,There are five positions on a basketball court.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.56,0:02:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m the small forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.08,0:02:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m the power forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.16,0:02:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I guess I’m the middle forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.28,0:02:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re playing shooting guard—
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.96,0:02:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,which means you’re responsible for scoring.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.12,0:02:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what does a point guard do?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.00,0:02:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,A point guard’s main responsibilities are
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.64,0:02:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,handling the ball, beating defenders, and passing to teammates to score.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.72,0:02:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,With a good point guard,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.64,0:02:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,the team plays much more smoothly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.68,0:02:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No time to waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.52,0:02:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s continue the tryouts to select a point guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.16,0:02:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Tryouts over.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.68,0:03:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of so many people, not a single one is suitable to play point guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.32,0:03:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,A point guard is essential. We’ll continue tryouts tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.92,0:03:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.52,0:03:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Tibbie?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.60,0:03:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Coach, Mr. Slowy,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.48,0:03:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to join the team.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.20,0:03:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s great! We were actually looking for a cheerleading squad.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.04,0:03:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheerleading squad?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.56,0:03:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to join the basketball team.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.56,0:03:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Tibbie,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.84,0:03:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You…play basketball?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.96,0:03:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I want to compete alongside my idol, Pantheress.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.60,0:03:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That way, I can get a little closer to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.88,0:03:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,So, the reason you’ve been missing these past few days…was to chase after your idol?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.88,0:03:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But getting onto the basketball team isn’t easy at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.00,0:03:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,First, you have to pass the tryouts.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.56,0:03:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The tryouts are really tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.80,0:03:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you should just join the cheerleading squad instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.76,0:03:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m not afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.72,0:03:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Coach, Mr. Slowy,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.32,0:04:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,please give me a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.92,0:04:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone can play basketball once they pass the tryouts.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.84,0:04:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Mr. Slowy. Thank you, Coach.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.56,0:04:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll definitely give it my all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.56,0:04:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Tibbie barely passed the physical fitness test.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.60,0:04:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let’s begin the dribbling test.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.76,0:04:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn’t expect Tibbie to be such a good dribbler.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.52,0:04:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I often watch videos of Pantheress playing basketball.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.36,0:04:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Dribbling: pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.84,0:04:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Next up is the passing and catching test.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.16,0:04:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.64,0:04:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Her passing is pretty good, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.64,0:04:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Catch it well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.28,0:05:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.60,0:05:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You aren’t cut out for basketball.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.60,0:05:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Tibbie, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.96,0:05:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Tibbie, even though you did quite well on the other tests,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.48,0:05:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,to become a basketball player,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.00,0:05:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,you absolutely cannot be afraid of the ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.28,0:05:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn’t even dare to catch the ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.92,0:05:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Tibbie, don’t be too upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.36,0:05:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.08,0:05:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,There are actually many other ways to get closer to Pantheress.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.68,0:05:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You don’t {\i1}have{\i0} to join the basketball team.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.08,0:05:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can’t get close to this idol,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.40,0:05:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,you could just pick a different…idol.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.64,0:05:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Pantheress…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.08,0:05:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The tryouts continue tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.64,0:05:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Coach,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.48,0:05:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,please give me a little more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.48,0:05:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I can definitely overcome my fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.28,0:05:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Three days—I’ll test you again in three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.04,0:06:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Please pass me the ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.40,0:06:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, you can definitely overcome your fear of the ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.72,0:06:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The power of an idol is truly amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.96,0:06:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.72,0:06:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I…I’m sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.36,0:06:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.00,0:06:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do it, Tibbie.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.00,0:06:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, keep it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.40,0:06:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Just keep trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.80,0:07:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Still failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.40,0:07:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s great.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.52,0:07:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You bravely reached out and took the first step this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.04,0:07:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You’ll definitely succeed next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.96,0:07:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Come again!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.28,0:07:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Tibbie!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.52,0:07:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.36,0:07:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I’m almost overcoming my fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.96,0:07:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep passing the ball to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.68,0:07:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe we should stop practicing for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.56,0:07:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it looks painful just watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.60,0:07:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m fine. Pass the ball to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.88,0:07:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re injured and need to rest properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.16,0:07:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We won’t pass the ball to you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.80,0:08:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I’ll ask someone else for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.36,0:08:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Slowy, please help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.16,0:08:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I won’t make you a passing machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.52,0:08:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look at you—you’re injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.00,0:08:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet you still want to keep practicing, all just to chase after a star player.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.04,0:08:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Slowy. That’s not how it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.60,0:08:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,When I was a child,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.28,0:08:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I was very weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.36,0:08:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I would cry at the slightest difficulty or setback.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.92,0:08:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I really disliked that side of myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.32,0:08:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But I didn’t know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.04,0:08:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Until that day…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.52,0:08:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw Pantheress.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.36,0:08:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how many times she fell on the court,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.76,0:08:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,she would get back up and save the ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.76,0:09:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That was when I realized that girls could be so brave
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.36,0:09:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,and so strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.72,0:09:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to join the basketball team.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.80,0:09:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s not just about being closer to Pantheress.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.92,0:09:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,More importantly,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.28,0:09:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to become a strong person like Pantheress through playing basketball.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.24,0:09:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Slowy, can you help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.60,0:09:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,—So that’s how it is.　—Are you okay, Mr. Slowy?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.56,0:09:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You silly child…just wait a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.04,0:09:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,This passing machine can mimic the force and angle of real passes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.24,0:09:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You can use it to practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.24,0:09:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But make sure you take care of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.20,0:09:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Mr. Slowy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.56,0:09:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Please help me start the passing machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.28,0:09:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.84,0:09:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.88,0:10:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie, think of a way to help Tibbie!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.48,0:10:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,No need; trust Tibbie.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.72,0:10:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,She has this spirit of never giving up on a goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.24,0:10:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,She’s bound to succeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.16,0:10:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Paddi is proof of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.48,0:10:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.56,0:10:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Tibbie, keep it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.84,0:10:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, coach, for giving me another chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.36,0:10:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.28,0:10:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Tibbie, keep it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.44,0:10:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We believe in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.72,0:10:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.92,0:10:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.36,0:11:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.60,0:11:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Tibbie, believe in yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.20,0:11:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.40,0:11:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.72,0:12:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Coach, Tibbie—
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.16,0:12:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Tibbie, playing point guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.52,0:12:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t be late for training tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.48,0:12:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.00,0:12:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I passed the tryout.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.80,0:12:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Tibbie, you did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.12,0:12:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Pantheress, I did it!
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
